## Interface: 120105
## Title: Compass - TrackerExt
## Title-zhCN: Compass - 追踪扩展
## Notes: Companion addon for Compass (Boussole) that adds CompassHUD-style supertracking to its compass: tracked-target icons & distance, edge pointers, scale ticks and emphasis.
## Notes-zhCN: Compass（Boussole）的扩展子插件，为其罗盘补齐 CompassHUD 式超追踪能力：追踪目标图标与距离、贴边指针、刻度数字与强调。
